526
00:41:37.005 --> 00:41:38.255
Mamadou.

527
00:41:39.130 --> 00:41:41.630
Come and get in the car with me.

528
00:41:42.547 --> 00:41:43.713
Come with me.

529
00:42:14.713 --> 00:42:15.713
Mamadou?

530
00:42:16.463 --> 00:42:17.463
