twice as hard or kill them.

626
00:48:42.047 --> 00:48:43.047
Shit.

627
00:48:44.255 --> 00:48:47.172
I'm sorry.
It's a really tricky situation...

628
00:48:49.005 --> 00:48:50.422
Tell him that if he needs help,

629
00:48:51.297 --> 00:48:52.880
