NASA is missing out!

712
00:55:20.338 --> 00:55:23.047
- Ely, try the engine.
- OK!

713
00:55:25.963 --> 00:55:28.505
We should have left him
at the military post.

714
00:55:29.047 --> 00:55:32.588
