737
00:57:06.088 --> 00:57:07.088
Yeah,

738
00:57:07.880 --> 00:57:09.297
but you can't see them.

739
00:57:11.547 --> 00:57:12.838
Take your shoes off.

740
00:57:14.380 --> 00:57:15.422
