1190
01:39:49.880 --> 01:39:52.505
Jean Pierre, Tocho, come here.

1191
01:40:53.672 --> 01:40:56.797
<i>People love the desert,
and I'm not saying it's a bad place,</i>

1192
01:40:57.880 --> 01:41:02.505
